# Fork-owned. Upstream has no .gitattributes, so this file can never conflict.

# Normalise line endings. This repo is developed on Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true, which checks files out as CRLF while prettier and cargo fmt
# write LF. Every format run then reported eighty files as modified with no
# content change, which makes `git status` useless in the middle of a sync, and a
# useless status is how a real change gets lost in the noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, never hand-merged: `cargo check` settles the lockfile and running
# the app regenerates the bindings. Which side wins a merge is irrelevant because
# both get overwritten immediately, so take either and stop asking.
# Needs `git config merge.ours.driver true` once per clone; see docs/FORK_RECIPE.md.
src/bindings.ts merge=ours
src-tauri/Cargo.lock merge=ours
